      <span class="eyebrow">How Google Ads works</span>
      <h2>Every click you buy is settled by an <span class="hl">auction</span></h2>
      <p>Google decides who appears in milliseconds, and the winner isn't simply whoever bids most. Ad relevance, expected click-through rate and landing page experience all feed into it, which is why account structure and tracking move performance more than bid changes do.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:14px">The panel opposite is a simplified illustration of what managing an account looks like day to day.</p>
    </div>
